    "answer": {
      "short": "$n=2$. Scaffold results in expression order: $2,\\ 10,\\ 12,\\ 3,\\ 9,\\ 15,\\ 3,\\ 21,\\ 20$.",
      "worked": "Undo the operations in reverse order, starting from $10$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\dfrac{7\\left(\\dfrac{3\\left[\\dfrac{5n+2}{4}\\right]+6}{5}\\right)-1}{2}&=10\\\\7\\left(\\dfrac{3\\left[\\dfrac{5n+2}{4}\\right]+6}{5}\\right)-1&=20\\\\7\\left(\\dfrac{3\\left[\\dfrac{5n+2}{4}\\right]+6}{5}\\right)&=21\\\\\\dfrac{3\\left[\\dfrac{5n+2}{4}\\right]+6}{5}&=3\\\\3\\left[\\dfrac{5n+2}{4}\\right]+6&=15\\\\3\\left[\\dfrac{5n+2}{4}\\right]&=9\\\\\\dfrac{5n+2}{4}&=3\\\\5n+2&=12\\\\5n&=10\\\\n&=2\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
